{"ID":"20240118151053-3r2v138","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151053-3r2v138","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151053-3r2v138\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151053-wdmcnk9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240202100749-y8wn94b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151053-wdmcnk9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"245蜚蠊（蟑螂）","type":"doc","updated":"20240202100757"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151053-wdmcnk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151053-wdmcnk9","updated":"20240202100757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，有毒。治血瘀症坚，寒热，破积聚，喉咽痹，内寒无子。生川泽及人家屋间。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122141640-r749x1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141640-r749x1u"}},{"ID":"20240122141641-ucopj6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141641-ucopj6q","updated":"20240202100754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这245我们叫蜚蠊。蜚蠊你知道是什么，就是蟑螂。蟑螂的古原名叫蜚蠊。味是咸的，寒，有毒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治血瘀症坚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这种虫类的药，甲壳类的药，外面是硬壳，身体在里面，外面是硬壳，都有攻坚的效果。关节炎都可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141645-pjbsyoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141645-pjbsyoz","updated":"20240202100658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老外很开明，你说这是蟑螂，嗯，都是高蛋白的，很好吃，他可以吃。那你知道的话，你说“老师蟑螂可以吃，对不对？”那天你不幸，我讲过的，你飞机失事，掉到山里面去没东西吃，抓来吃嘛。那脚要剪掉。脚和翅膀剪掉。吃的时候要有CommonSense。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141654-9h3gxkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141654-9h3gxkh","updated":"20240202100710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动物类的药，攻瘀血的时候都是非常的峻。很强啊。所以你不要随便吃，没有必要不要吃，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这种虻虫没有必要，不对症的时候不要吃。没有那个症不要吃，有那个症的时候是唯一的处方。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一剂下去就好了，好了以后不要再吃啦。"}]},{"ID":"20240122141659-le32cyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122141659-le32cyd","updated":"20240202100748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个人刚好是你岳母怎么办，好了，当时很好，今天晚上很感谢你，不需要了，你还给他吃，第二天能恨死你。人吃了会虚掉，因为它很强的攻坚的药，没有必要你还在攻它，它不坚了嘛。很不好。所以最好不要随便乱用。到就好啦，药中了就可以啦。平常我们蟑螂呢，也是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"活血化瘀的，能够治肿瘤，硬块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统统可以使用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瘀血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是蜚蠊。"}]},{"ID":"20240202100749-y8wn94b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240202100749-y8wn94b"}}]}